    \ "Renamed"   : "→",
    \ "Unmerged"  : "═",
    \ "Deleted"   : "×",
    \ "Dirty"     : "※",
    \ "Clean"     : "√",
    \ "Unknown"   : "?"
    \ }

"Rainbow 对xml格式化有影响
